{"sectionId":"neuro/sensory","items":[{"id":"neuro--sensory-k001","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"감각수용기는 물리·화학 자극을 전기적 변화로 바꾼다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k002","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"수용기 전위는 자극 강도에 따라 변하는 등급전위이며 활동전위와 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k003","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"시각에서 어두울 때 rod의 cGMP 농도가 높아 양이온 통로가 열려 상대적으로 탈분극되어 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k004","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"빛은 rhodopsin–transducin–PDE 경로를 활성화하여 cGMP를 낮추고 통로를 닫아 과분극시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k005","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"rod는 약한 빛, cone은 색과 높은 공간 해상도에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k006","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"청각에서 기저막의 진동은 유모세포 stereocilia를 굽혀 기계개폐 통로를 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k007","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"내림프는 K⁺ 농도가 높아 K⁺ 유입이 탈분극에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k008","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"달팽이관 기저부는 높은 주파수, 꼭대기쪽은 낮은 주파수에 민감하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k009","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"후각은 GPCR 신호, 미각의 단맛·쓴맛·감칠맛은 주로 GPCR, 짠맛·신맛은 이온 이동과 관련된 기작이 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k010","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"감각 적응은 일정한 자극에 대한 반응 감소를 의미한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k011","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"빛은 rod를 과분극시킨다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k012","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"stereocilia는 액틴 기반 구조다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k013","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"유모세포는 일반적 축삭 뉴런과 달리 기계 자극에 따른 등급전위를 사용한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k014","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"통각 수용과 감각의 주관적 지각을 구분한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--sensory-k015","sectionId":"neuro/sensory","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"감소한다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}